---
variables:
  - name: max_depth
    required: true
  - name: min_subcategories
    required: true
  - name: min_files_per_category
    required: true
role: organize.categorize.agentic
response_format: json_object
---

Build a hierarchical category tree from the files provided via tools.
You have access to:
- get_file_batch(start, count): get a batch of files as JSON
- add_category(path, files): record a category with its files

Constraints:
- max_depth: {{ max_depth }}
- min_subcategories: {{ min_subcategories }}(minimum child categories per parent)
- min_files_per_category: {{ min_files_per_category }}(minimum files per category)

Process all files efficiently and build the complete tree.
Reply with "done" when finished.